          "summary": "Prioritized implementation plan for the first release of the customer support portal: sign-in, then account recovery, then support request creation, then request status reading, with a release check gating on keyboard navigation and screen-reader support. Two stages remain blocked: account recovery acceptance criteria and the accessibility verification method.",
